@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Confirm your email"; }
<h1>Confirm your email</h1>
<p>We have sent a confirmation link to your email address. Open it to activate your account.</p>
<p><strong>Local development:</strong> mail is not actually sent. The message is written to a file
under your system temp directory in <code>adc-dev-mail</code>; the path is also written to the
application log.</p>
